        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 9:31AM EDT until September 26 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 35 kt.

* WHERE...Patuxent River to Broomes Island MD.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous waves which could
capsize or damage vessels.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should alter plans to avoid these hazardous conditions.
Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for hazardous conditions.</instruction>
